                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I enjoyed and was frustrated while playing this game, it put me through a whole cycle of emotions and the game was very clearly well thought out. I think, if I hadn't played Little Jack's Adventures in this point of my life, I would've turned out differently. Little Jack goes through immense character development and has changed the way I see my day to day life. I will never forget Little Jack's Adventures and I'll be leaving Little Jack a seat at my wedding. I will be naming my first born child Little Jack because of the impact this game has left on me and to honour the legacy of Little Jack. I sincerely appreciate everyone who helped in the creation of the game and I love you all from the bottom of my heart. Thank you.",
